DTSTAMP:20261010T155031Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261009
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261011
SUMMARY:Fallfest at Catoctin Furnace
DESCRIPTION:For 62 years\, northern Frederick County has shared the glorious autumn colors of its mountain with visitors. Fallfest includes apple butter boiling in a copper kettle over an open fire\, blacksmithing\, food\, and crafts. Tour historic buildings including the Museum of the Ironworker.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/fallfest-at-catoctin-furnace/15524/
