SUMMARY:A Very Spooky Paint 'n Sip
DESCRIPTION:'Tis the season for cozy\, spooky activities! Frederick based artist\, Nina Harrast\, will be hosting A Very Spooky Paint ’n Sip in our taproom on Saturday\, October 10th! In this 2-hour\, Bob Ross–style class\, Nina will guide you step-by-step in creating your very own Halloween-scene masterpiece. Whether you’ve been painting for years or have never picked up a brush\, this event is designed for everyone. Bring your creativity\, roll up your sleeves\, and get painting! Your ticket includes all materials needed\, along with one full pour of any one of our beers\, NA brews or soft drinks. Limited seats\, so reserve your spot now!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/a-very-spooky-paint-n-sip/26202/
END:VEVENT
